{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_title", "source_sha256": "d5c8d130c4291273b4911e452cf25e6853dc231a8273efc599d082673f4203db", "ja": "春香と舞台裏", "zh": "春香与后台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f9c439772f1d6610887310dce19c7333f87d52e7a643ece15bf939a2f61793b8", "ja": "春香との舞台裏の一幕です。", "zh": "这是与春香在后台的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1000_p", "source_sha256": "19d29c9652e0faf1b518ec0a81d799c67b7089d3bcccbc4e4ef5daaa53326719", "ja": "（『765PRO ALLSTARS』の記念碑的な公演が、\nついに開演！　客席は凄い盛り上がりを見せている）", "zh": "（『765PRO ALLSTARS』具有纪念意义的公演终于开演了！观众席一片沸腾）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "52363752afafb3587c1c15b62c031f0b0819ea6e38dca108bf220e3993d6a00c", "ja": "ふう……{$P$}さん、\nお疲れさまです！　ライブ、どうですか？", "zh": "呼……{$P$}先生，辛苦了！演唱会感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5a123e11b4406379aea54ea799002efc3e32dbb0f9b823f36d3bd706ab197a76", "ja": "お疲れ様。まだ感想には早いけど、\nいい滑り出しだと思うよ。この調子でいこう！", "zh": "辛苦了。现在说感想还太早，不过我觉得开局不错。就照这个势头继续吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "3b065dbb10b073502e1842cf72aff36de4a3365e36aafbe205049c8c955b76c5", "ja": "はいっ！　えへへ、よかった……♪\nっとと、いけない、すぐに次の準備しなきゃ。", "zh": "好！嘿嘿，太好了……♪\n啊，不行，得马上准备下一场才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "dd78403778af0543c588e988aeac65539c190eb09a1d0a8e887ad21b6bf6940e", "ja": "マイクのバッテリーと、イヤモニのチェック。\nそれから、メイクと衣装も……！", "zh": "检查麦克风的电池，还有入耳式监听器。\n然后，妆容和服装也要检查……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f1575644d78d7b49999ec020ae782541af7919d674d1b8aac02416ef64dce5c2", "ja": "あと、タオルも。体を冷やさないように。\n水も補充したほうがいいかな。", "zh": "还有毛巾。别让身体着凉了。\n水是不是也补充一下比较好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "1b3e6455d524d45c88cc45d6e2844aadccb9aad874ad09499d6075613a27df8c", "ja": "あっ、ありがとうございます！\nごめんなさい、バタバタしちゃって。", "zh": "啊，谢谢你！\n抱歉，弄得手忙脚乱的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6be1878286f8282ebead9d76c0fe0c115ea20eca48972bc8c410272174d362f4", "ja": "ライブなんだからしょうがないよ。\nいろいろ新しいことにも挑戦してもらってるし。", "zh": "毕竟是演唱会嘛，没办法。\n而且还让大家挑战了各种新东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "29e5fdfd5e300e227f15c93acff17dfd75553bd80db7bf87e3b1ad7b168050bf", "ja": "それはそうなんですけど。ライブの時って、\nいつもこんな感じになっちゃって……。", "zh": "话是这么说没错。可是每次演出的时候，总是不知不觉变成这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "a1c004746eaee06b8b76254e3740a4999a58a565e0b25ddce41bec35385749d1", "ja": "あ、でも{$P$}さんは、\nそんなことない……ことも、ないですか？", "zh": "啊，不过{$P$}先生也不是完全不会这样……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5776693e70bc8fa97b59509fd973ed5bad9226b6a8b9a7ff698a1bd3a20d0e04", "ja": "ああ、春香と同じだよ。\n何回やっても落ち着かなくて、今日もバタバタしてる。", "zh": "啊，和春香一样哦。\n不管做多少次都没法镇定下来，今天也一直手忙脚乱的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "ab834fbcd2275d3b70e92ab31eed831c899f82a75a358745eb51e283730b5afd", "ja": "ふふっ♪　変わらないですね、私たち。\nデビューした時から、ずっと同じような感じで。", "zh": "呵呵♪我们还是没变呢。\n从出道时开始，就一直是这个样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d89eca36d149bcbf3a9d8d73857ec94b9a11f50fc5238d0e45e24008631c68c0", "ja": "そうだな、成長したところも、もちろんあるけど。\n変わらないところは、変わらないな。", "zh": "是啊，当然也有成长的地方。不过没变的地方，还是没变啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "10edefb8424d4d0b6d462af04f7e8bf7e694c2b8e227b8290fc493980a473ba7", "ja": "そうですね。来年も再来年も、\nずっとずっと、こうしていられたらいいなぁ……♪", "zh": "是啊。要是明年、后年也能一直一直这样下去就好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "2e3e7098a78508de4ecd5318c16c8847ad578b1f06efcf93323b2de82d464378", "ja": "でも、それが一番難しいんですよね！　きっと、\n今こうしていられることが、何よりも奇跡だから……。", "zh": "不过，那才是最难的吧！一定是因为，能像现在这样一直在一起，本身就是最不可思议的奇迹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "b6d209f0323e1e9c17a4b6f231e63d60f319c3a45a1e7b11b1dc61de9108c901", "ja": "だから……だから、私……\n頑張りますね！　もっともっと。これからも。", "zh": "所以……所以，我……\n会加油的！今后也会更加努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6ec3f312a2aabe6e0c9d827c974b49a67ce5ec19f11ddd386fdefdc32120b6a6", "ja": "うん、もっともっと、これからも。\n一緒に頑張ろうな！", "zh": "嗯，今后也要更加更加努力。\n一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "e8106d05ea91b75b562ec818211915687d563a6dbaa4aecb0cc29bce9d42504f", "ja": "……、はいっ！", "zh": "……好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1018_staff", "source_sha256": "f3e31d6db6ea79d2681e5dde3f027ebfcc8c97f973001aaf7b07a349e8553089", "ja": "休憩あけまーす！　スタンバイ、お願いします！", "zh": "休息结束啦！请准备就绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0392_story_001har_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_001har_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "371b5e21208e38e4cb1004b04814865f9b6c0abd7605d3f39581105c4f550e0d", "ja": "ああっ、大変！　それじゃ……\n{$P$}さん、行ってきまーすっ！", "zh": "啊啊，不好了！那就……\n{$P$}先生，我出发啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
